           "aria-hidden-focus" (elemento aria-hidden contendo conteudo
           focavel) sempre que o JS (awa-back-to-top.js) removia soh o
           "hidden" ao rolar a pagina, sem tambem sincronizar o aria-hidden
           no mesmo instante. */ ?>
        aria-label="<?= $block->escapeHtmlAttr(__('Voltar ao topo')) ?>"
        title="<?= $block->escapeHtmlAttr(__('Voltar ao topo')) ?>"
        hidden>
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
         stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
